CAVEAT: categories too small to supply K same-category neighbours
================================================================================================
  cutoff_for_neighbors masks cross-category distances to inf, then DROPS the
  non-finite k-th distances -- so these categories do not help set the radius,
  and the arms are not measuring the same thing across the dataset.
